{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "8246378",
      "title": "Prop Drilling: Component Composition as a Solution",
      "sourceHash": "36cc6f8c6897cdf9cf9239a6ce6c9bc61afcd8b20ff311a94ca73e4b78361736",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.78,
          "end": 4.14,
          "en": "Now one possible solution for this drilling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.14,
          "end": 9.03,
          "en": "problem is to embrace component composition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.03,
          "end": 12.981,
          "en": "And I will say right away that this can be part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.981,
          "end": 17.88,
          "en": "of the overall solution, that this can solve prop drilling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.88,
          "end": 21.87,
          "en": "in certain situations, but that in most cases,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 21.87,
          "end": 24.3,
          "en": "you'll also need that second solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 24.3,
          "end": 25.65,
          "en": "we'll take a look at later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.65,
          "end": 28.983,
          "en": "But for now, let's explore this possible solution here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.36,
          "end": 34.44,
          "en": "And to explore this concept of component composition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.44,
          "end": 37.08,
          "en": "here in this project I prepared for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.08,
          "end": 39.9,
          "en": "in the shop component, we could say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.9,
          "end": 44.548,
          "en": "that outputting that list of products here could be moved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.548,
          "end": 49.113,
          "en": "from the shop component directly to the app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 50.07,
          "end": 54.69,
          "en": "Which would then have the advantage that this pointer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 54.69,
          "end": 58.559,
          "en": "at this handleAddItemToCart function would not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 58.559,
          "end": 61.89,
          "en": "have to be passed to the shop component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 61.89,
          "end": 65.193,
          "en": "but could directly be passed to the products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 66.42,
          "end": 69.75,
          "en": "Now, I don't want to delete the shop component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 69.75,
          "end": 73.95,
          "en": "Instead, I want to embrace component composition",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 73.95,
          "end": 77.13,
          "en": "by refactoring this shop component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 77.13,
          "end": 80.583,
          "en": "to a wrapper around a list of products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 81.45,
          "end": 82.98,
          "en": "And to show you what I mean,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 82.98,
          "end": 87.211,
          "en": "let's grab this code here where I'm mapping",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 87.211,
          "end": 90.9,
          "en": "through my dummy products to render these list items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 90.9,
          "end": 93.7,
          "en": "And let's cut it from the shop component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 94.83,
          "end": 97.263,
          "en": "and instead go to the app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 98.13,
          "end": 102.99000000000001,
          "en": "And then there, actually change this shop component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 102.99000000000001,
          "end": 105.06,
          "en": "from a self-closing component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 105.06,
          "end": 108.483,
          "en": "to a component that has a opening and closing tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 110.00999999999999,
          "end": 114.03,
          "en": "And move that code to output that list here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 114.03,
          "end": 116.88,
          "en": "into the app component between the opening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 116.88,
          "end": 119.10300000000001,
          "en": "and closing tags of the shop component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 120.96,
          "end": 124.59,
          "en": "Now if you make that change, you also have to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 124.59,
          "end": 129.54,
          "en": "import those dummy products from the dummy products JS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 129.54,
          "end": 131.07,
          "en": "into the app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 131.07,
          "end": 133.953,
          "en": "But thankfully I'm already doing that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 135.39,
          "end": 140.141,
          "en": "We can remove that import from the shop JSX file though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 140.141,
          "end": 144,
          "en": "and we can now also remove the product component import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 144,
          "end": 148.23,
          "en": "from that shop component file and instead import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 148.23,
          "end": 151.74,
          "en": "that component here in the app JSX file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 151.74,
          "end": 153.99,
          "en": "So import that product component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 153.99,
          "end": 157.833,
          "en": "from ./components/Product.jsx.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 159.72,
          "end": 164.34,
          "en": "And with that import added here, we can now output that list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 164.34,
          "end": 165.753,
          "en": "of products down here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 167.01,
          "end": 169.56,
          "en": "Now we of course just have to make sure that we now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 169.56,
          "end": 173.85,
          "en": "pass the right function to this onAddToCart prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 173.85,
          "end": 176.7,
          "en": "This product component is expecting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 176.7,
          "end": 178.84,
          "en": "And the function we wanna pass here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 179.96,
          "end": 183.153,
          "en": "is this handleAddItemToCart function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 184.8,
          "end": 187.47,
          "en": "So we can now copy that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 187.47,
          "end": 190.143,
          "en": "and use that as a value for onAddToCart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 192.6,
          "end": 196.47,
          "en": "And with that, we still have the shop component as a wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 196.47,
          "end": 199.77,
          "en": "but we have the logic for outputting the products",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 199.77,
          "end": 203.19,
          "en": "and the usage of that product component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 203.19,
          "end": 205.59,
          "en": "in the app component now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 205.59,
          "end": 210.06,
          "en": "Which now means that we no longer have to pass a pointer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 210.06,
          "end": 213.3,
          "en": "at this handleAddItemToCart function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 213.3,
          "end": 214.923,
          "en": "to the shop component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 215.94,
          "end": 219.66,
          "en": "Instead there we can now get rid of this prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 219.66,
          "end": 222.51,
          "en": "because in the shop component, it's not needed anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 222.51,
          "end": 224.79,
          "en": "We can also get rid of it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 224.79,
          "end": 227.463,
          "en": "because we no longer render the products in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 228.57,
          "end": 231.57999999999998,
          "en": "Instead, what we should now do in the shop component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 232.817,
          "end": 235.47,
          "en": "is that we should accept this special children prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 235.47,
          "end": 240.36,
          "en": "you learned about, so that we can use this custom component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 240.36,
          "end": 243.24,
          "en": "as a wrapper with opening and closing tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 243.24,
          "end": 245.073,
          "en": "around this product list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 246.3,
          "end": 251.3,
          "en": "So that we output our children here in this unordered list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 253.89,
          "end": 257.64,
          "en": "And with that, we're embracing component composition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 257.64,
          "end": 259.56,
          "en": "and we're using the shop component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 259.56,
          "end": 262.8,
          "en": "around the wrapper of that list of products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 262.8,
          "end": 265.11,
          "en": "And we therefore kind of got rid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 265.11,
          "end": 267.57,
          "en": "of one layer of component nesting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 267.57,
          "end": 270.663,
          "en": "and we're instead outputting the list of products here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 272.07,
          "end": 275.88,
          "en": "And therefore, now if I save that and I reload my app here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 275.88,
          "end": 279.09000000000003,
          "en": "I can still add items to my cart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 279.09000000000003,
          "end": 281.82,
          "en": "and I can still view and edit that cart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 281.82,
          "end": 283.62,
          "en": "But now we at least got rid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 283.62,
          "end": 286.413,
          "en": "of parts of that prop drilling problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 287.46,
          "end": 290.73,
          "en": "Though, and that's the downside of this solution,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 290.73,
          "end": 293.79,
          "en": "you typically don't want to use this solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 293.79,
          "end": 296.15999999999997,
          "en": "for all your component layers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 296.15999999999997,
          "end": 297.87,
          "en": "Because it would mean that in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 297.87,
          "end": 301.47,
          "en": "all your components just end up in the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 301.47,
          "end": 305.25,
          "en": "and all the other components are just wrapper components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 305.25,
          "end": 307.68,
          "en": "Which you could do, but which would",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 307.68,
          "end": 311.43,
          "en": "of course lead to a pretty bloated app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 311.43,
          "end": 314.19,
          "en": "And that's why we're now also going to explore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 314.19,
          "end": 316.053,
          "en": "another possible solution.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}